# SecurePi Gateway - services that must be active at all times.
#
# This is the single source of truth for "is the gateway fully up". Both
# securepi status (on the gateway), session-start.sh (on the Mac), and
# app/health.py's platform health supervisor (step 3.5) read this file,
# so a new service only needs to be added HERE to be checked everywhere -
# update this whenever a new always-on systemd unit is added.
#
# Format: one service name per line. Blank lines and #-comments ignored.

hostapd
securepi-ap-follow-uplink
securepi-ap0
AdGuardHome
nftables
securepi-dpi
securepi-ca-server
securepi-test-harness
suricata
securepi-ingest
securepi-engine
securepi-web
securepi-doh-refresh.timer
securepi-static
securepi-intel-refresh.timer
securepi-ids-logrotate.timer
